<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Rope - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Rope - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 35.24		vs	   35.15</p>
<p> Operating	  931    million    vs	    1.13</p>
<p> Current		1.08		vs	    1.15</p>
<p> Net		  610    million    vs	  666    million</p>
